{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00876","headline":"鼓吹曲辞 将进酒 · 李贺","name":"鼓吹曲辞 将进酒","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"瑠璃锺，琥珀浓，小槽酒滴真珠红。\n烹龙炮凤玉脂泣，罗屏绣幕围香风。\n吹龙笛，击鼍鼓，皓齿歌，细腰舞。\n况是青春日将暮，桃花乱落如红雨。\n劝君终日酩酊醉，酒不到刘伶坟上土。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00876.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00876","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}